  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC Cooperative Agreement 2019-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the third year of USADF&apos;s Partner Cooperative Agreement in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. Funds disbursed to provide liquidity in light of unanticipated shocks impacting project activities and grantee enterprises due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Funds to assist with project needs in light of fund shortage due to COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
